Repo gates also green at this commit: make test, make lint.

priv_directed.S drives 14 test groups under --irq-timer-after 2000:
CSR round-trips and masks, S-mode drop via MRET, delegated ECALL to
S, PMP load/store/execute denials (incl. a NAPOT X-deny page taking
an instruction access fault), M timer interrupt with precise epc,
delegated supervisor timer interrupt taken in S (cause
0x8000000000000005), counter CSRs, MPRV data path, and
illegal-CSR/privilege violations. csr_tb.cpp checks the CSR file
directly at its ports: write masks, delegation steering, vectored
trap targets, interrupt priority (MEI > MSI > MTI > SEI > SSI >
STI), xRET state shuffles, PMP OFF/TOR/NA4/NAPOT matching,
W-without-R WARL, and entry/adjacent-TOR locking.
